# .harnessignore -- paths the framework's arch tests and lint hooks skip.
#
# One pattern per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
# A pattern with no "/" matches any path segment (e.g. "vendor" skips
# src/vendor/anything). A pattern containing "/" matches as a substring of
# the forward-slash-normalized path, relative to the project root.
# No globbing, no negation.
#
# Use this for vendored/reference/research code you didn't write and don't
# want linted or arch-checked -- without editing a framework-owned file
# (see docs/how-to/file-ownership.md). This file is yours; upgrade seeds it
# once and never overwrites it.
